post_upgrade() {
	cat <<'EOF'
==> SimplySign Desktop stores its configuration in ~/SimplySignDesktop.xml.
    A configuration from an older version can make the new version crash on
    startup. If SimplySign Desktop no longer starts after this upgrade, refresh
    the config from the bundled template:

      cp /usr/lib/procertum-simplysign-desktop/SimplySignDesktop.xml ~/SimplySignDesktop.xml

    Your SimplySign login is stored separately and is not affected.
EOF
}
